{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42739","headline":"梦归故园 二 · 刘兼","name":"梦归故园 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧馆秋寒夜梦长，水帘疎影入回塘。\n宦情率尔拖鱼艇，客恨依然在燕梁。\n白鹭独飘山面雪，红蕖全谢镜心香。\n起来不语无人会，醉倚东轩半夕阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42739.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42739","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}